#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:58
#: 0c9981e6438944328de054b37557ff17
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:59
#: 884d35c725324c998dcd2866daa730de
msgid ""
"RC input is configured by default via the USART6 RX input. It supports all "
"serial RC protocols except PPM."
msgstr "RC 输入默认通过 USART6 RX 配置。支持除 PPM 以外的所有串行 RC 协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:61
#: 7949489ebac744be8031b670f1539dd4
msgid ""
"Note: If the receiver is FPort the receiver must be tied to the USART6 TX "
"pin , RSSI_TYPE set to 3, and :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` must "
"be set to 7 (invert TX/RX, half duplex). For full duplex like CRSF/ELRS use "
"both RX6 and TX6 and set :ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` also to 3."
msgstr ""
"注意：若接收机为 FPort，必须将接收机连接到 USART6 TX 引脚，RSSI_TYPE 设置为 3，并将 "
":ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 7（TX/RX 反相，半双工）。对于 CRSF/ELRS "
"等全双工协议，同时使用 RX6 和 TX6，并将 :ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` 也设置为 3。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:64
#: 67774f733fd847e2bc32febbf08f2b50
msgid ""
"If SBUS is used on HD VTX connector (DJI TX), then "
":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOl<SERIAL1_PROTOCOl>` should be set to \"23\" and "
":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` changed to something else."
msgstr ""
"若在高清 VTX 连接器（DJI TX）上使用 SBUS，则应将 :ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOl<SERIAL1_PROTOCOl>` "
"设置为 「23」，并将 :ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` 更改为其他值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:67
#: 0ab1fadcb6a44a418bf6a7473457f139
msgid "FrSky Telemetry"
msgstr "FrSky 数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:68
#: 9a5be64a44b3459dbdd5b727250e5ede
msgid ""
"FrSky Telemetry is supported using an unused UART, such as the T1 pin (UART1"
" transmit). You need to set the following parameters to enable support for "
"FrSky S.PORT:"
msgstr "FrSky 数传通过未使用的 UART 支持，如 T1 引脚（UART1 发送）。需要设置以下参数以启用 FrSky S.PORT 支持："

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:72
#: 5ed59b5394c348e8a440c382de8f63e5
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = 10"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:73
#: e4face5d80fa470c9abb7261c5597950
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` = 7"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` = 7"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:76
#: 842d16c33baa4a0aa979f9e365e7aa5a
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:77
#: b36d05c0794b4e549c4e9b5aa2d46b09
msgid ""
"The TBS LUCID H7 supports OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 (MAX7456 driver) and "
"simultaneously DisplayPort using TX3/RX3 on the HD VTX connector."
msgstr ""
"TBS LUCID H7 支持使用 OSD_TYPE 1（MAX7456 驱动）的 OSD，同时通过高清 VTX 连接器上的 TX3/RX3 支持 "
"DisplayPort。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:80
#: e770be738bbf4e88bce9e6f9c15910cd
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:81
#: b41477d039c24475b5a52e8023d56990
msgid ""
"The TBS LUCID H7 supports up to 13 PWM or DShot outputs. The pads for motor "
"output M1 to M4 are provided on both the motor connectors and on separate "
"pads, plus M9-13 on a separate pads for LED strip and other PWM outputs."
msgstr ""
"TBS LUCID H7 最多支持 13 路 PWM 或 DShot 输出。电机输出 M1 至 M4 的焊盘同时提供在电机连接器和独立焊盘上，另有 "
"M9–13 的独立焊盘用于 LED 灯带和其他 PWM 输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:85
#: e52fab6963af4aabb86f0bc99689887a
msgid "The PWM is in 4 groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为 4 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:88
#: 0877da344cd84ad181613140239cef7a
msgid "PWM 1-2   in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1–2 在第1组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:89
#: e2f9a286ed3b4d0e82ca12fcefa8e7e7
msgid "PWM 3-4   in group2"
msgstr "PWM 3–4 在第2组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:90
#: 001856fda23044e7ac2b5bef92717c3a
msgid "PWM 5-6   in group3"
msgstr "PWM 5–6 在第3组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:91
#: 0c854ef922b149c1becf0449aaed5624
msgid "PWM 7-10  in group4"
msgstr "PWM 7–10 在第4组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:92
#: 1468430a368e45478c238b04639ec092
msgid "PWM 11-12 in group5"
msgstr "PWM 11–12 在第5组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:93
#: 051ab55775d94b8eb671463b076fe181
msgid "PWM 13    in group6"
msgstr "PWM 13 在第6组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:95
#: e1fb8e7fd00c48b981a5ab2f2355d3df
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot. Channels 1-10 support bi-directional dshot."
msgstr ""
"同组内的通道必须使用相同输出频率。若某组内任一通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道均需使用 DShot。通道 1–10 支持双向 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:100
#: b73a221360084ffaafd0edaaa0b4ec95
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:101
#: 847ccc3e8a7447e3ac115d160e05efcc
msgid ""
"The board has a built-in voltage sensor and external current sensor input. "
"The current sensor can read up to 130 Amps. The voltage sensor can handle up"
" to 6S LiPo batteries."
msgstr "板载内置电压传感器和外部电流传感器输入。电流传感器最大可读取 130A。电压传感器最高支持 6S 锂电池。"

