#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:130
#: 509aa978cf5149f3bb21e7dba3fc0628
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:132
#: 427edf741bb94357899b8d0acc2b0057
msgid ""
"The TBS LUCID H7 does not have a builtin compass, but you can attach an "
"external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "TBS LUCID H7 没有内置罗盘，但可通过 SDA 和 SCL 焊盘上的 I2C 连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:135
#: f25c1d39c15a40ecb4e8d1fbcdb78900
msgid "VTX power control"
msgstr "VTX 电源控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:137
#: c2babdb204d3428bbb73a1e6b423de66
msgid ""
"GPIO 81 controls the VSW pins which can be set to output either VBAT or 5V "
"via a board jumper. Setting this GPIO high removes voltage supply to pins. "
"RELAY2 is configured by default to control this GPIO and is low by default."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 81 控制 VSW 引脚，可通过板上跳线选择输出 VBAT 或 5V。将此 GPIO 拉高将切断引脚供电。RELAY2 默认配置用于控制此 "
"GPIO，默认为低。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:139
#: 7216a6a309a443588b20486a437d85ff
msgid ""
"GPIO 83 controls the VTX BEC output to pins marked \"9V\" and is included on"
" the HD VTX connector. Setting this GPIO low removes voltage supply to this "
"pin/pad."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 83 控制 VTX BEC 输出到标有 「9V」 的引脚（位于高清 VTX 连接器上）。将此 GPIO 拉低将切断该引脚/焊盘的供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:141
#: 341b711ee9e24fcb95e8a6ce9f78af3b
msgid ""
"By default RELAY4 is configured to control this pin and sets the GPIO high."
msgstr "默认情况下 RELAY4 配置用于控制此引脚，并将 GPIO 设为高。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:144
#: 0da133d0623945f1a7321b96c62399c2
msgid "Camera control"
msgstr "相机控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:145
#: bb8fe5594fbe481dad8cf17f08cbe5fb
msgid ""
"GPIO 82 controls the camera output to the connectors marked \"CAM1\" and "
"\"CAM2\". Setting this GPIO low switches the video output from CAM1 to CAM2."
" By default RELAY3 is configured to control this pin and sets the GPIO high."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 82 控制标有 「CAM1」 和 「CAM2」 连接器的相机输出。将此 GPIO 拉低将视频输出从 CAM1 切换到 CAM2。默认情况下 "
"RELAY3 配置用于控制此引脚，并将 GPIO 设为高。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:148
#: 0833e4d86de2485cbb09b44e55fa7b7d
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:149
#: 79e9366ec4294800a7a45b81f9d7d9dd
msgid ""
"Firmware for this board can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ in sub-folders labeled “TBS_LUCID_H7”"
msgstr ""
"此板的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ 的子文件夹 「TBS_LUCID_H7」 中找到"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:152
#: 0fa6db749f664ad4aaf8f9344f841d24
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:153
#: 4afc3fbd0bf04e5d99feb2abae6a34e7
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr "初始固件加载可通过 DFU 完成：按住引导程序按钮插入 USB。然后使用您喜欢的 DFU 加载工具加载 「with_bl.hex」 固件。"

